Because the prior distribution is beta distributed with $a=4$ and $b=1$, we know that the posterior distribution of parameter $q$ is given by  egin{align*} f_{Q|\mathbf{X}=\mathbf{x}}(q) =&\,  rac{\Gamma(4+1+4)}{\Gamma(4+2)\Gamma(1+4-2)} q^{4+2-1} (1-q)^{1+4-2-1}  
otag \ =&\,  rac{\Gamma(9)}{\Gamma(6)\Gamma(3)} q^{5} (1-q)^{2}  
otag \ =&\, 168 q^5 (1-q)^2, 
otag \end{align*} which is also a beta distribution with shape parameters 6 and 3, respectively.

segments.translation:
사전분포가 $a=4$와 $b=1$인 베타분포를 따르므로, 모수 $q$의 사후분포는  egin{align*} f_{Q|\mathbf{X}=\mathbf{x}}(q) =&\,  rac{\Gamma(4+1+4)}{\Gamma(4+2)\Gamma(1+4-2)} q^{4+2-1} (1-q)^{1+4-2-1}  
otag \ =&\,  rac{\Gamma(9)}{\Gamma(6)\Gamma(3)} q^{5} (1-q)^{2}  
otag \ =&\, 168 q^5 (1-q)^2, 
otag \end{align*}로 주어지며, 이 역시 형상모수가 각각 6과 3인 베타분포임을 알 수 있습니다.
